---
# 1.9.1: the stdlib takes adopt the owning marker, the vec_take/map_take name
# table and its shape guard are deleted, and the R2 spoof residual flips. A user func
# with vec_take's name and shape but no marker is no longer blessed, so a direct free
# of its result is condemned as a possible container alias (raise-only); the real std
# vec_take carries the marker and still blesses through the import path.
test spoof_unblessed_fail
mode check_fail
file examples/spoof_unblessed_fail.dusk
err_has cannot free a call result that may alias its arguments
---
test std_take_still_blessed
mode check_ok
file examples/std_take_still_blessed.dusk
---
# 1.9.1: vec_fold reduces a vector left to right from an initial accumulator, the
# accumulator type independent of the element type; a capturing closure combiner
# threads its environment through the generic call.
