# Two enums declare a variant of the same name, one payload a slice and the other a
# scalar. The escape check reads the constructor's payload types to decide whether an
# argument's frame view rides into the value, and a read keyed by the bare variant
# name answers with whichever enum was declared last, which types this slice from the
# scalar enum and lets a view of a dead frame out through the return.
