---
# A package.dawn beside the source turns a directory into a project, and these records
# drive that from the compiler's side: static fixtures under tests/dawn/, one project per
# record, with the checkouts and the lock already written so no record clones anything.
# The dawn_* specials above prove the tool that writes those files; these prove what the
# compiler reads back out of them.

